PATTERN from the exhaustive band: the only |S|=1 sets in [1,40] are
  {2,3,4,5,6,7} + 16   and   {2,3,4,5,6,7} + 32   -- both powers of two >= 16.

PREDICTION under test: {2,3,4,5,6,7} + 2^j has |S| = 1 for every j >= 4,
with sole flank 2^j. Falsifier: any j >= 4 giving |S| != 1.

    added x | |S| | supporting flanks | flanks dead by integer-ratio (8 | d/e)
